{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 0, "text": "// Player thinks + Make coffee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 1, "text": "ต้องให้ใครอีกคนมาช่วยดึง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 2, "text": "หวังว่ามิตะที่นี่จะไม่ดุนะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 3, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 4, "text": "นี่ฉันมัวทำอะไรอยู่เนี่ย..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 5, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 8, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 9, "text": "// Player tries to wake up MitaDreamer"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 10, "text": "มิตะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 11, "text": "มิตะ ตื่นสิ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 12, "text": "มิตะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 14, "text": "มิตะ รีบตื่นเร็วเข้า!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 15, "text": "ฉันต้องการให้เธอช่วย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 17, "text": "คุณคือใครรร?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 19, "text": "ไปช่วยฉันดึงสวิตช์หน่อย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 21, "text": "สวิตช์อะไร?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 22, "text": "ฉันขอนอนอีกหน่อยนะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 23, "text": "หรือไม่ก็ไปชงกาแฟมาให้ฉัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 25, "text": "เครื่องชงกาแฟอยู่ที่ไหนเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 26, "text": "มิตะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 27, "text": "มิ! ตะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 28, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 31, "text": "// Player gives away the coffee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 32, "text": "มิตะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 33, "text": "นี่กาแฟของเธอ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 37, "text": "// MitaDreamer exercise"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 38, "text": "คุณพูดถึงสวิตช์"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 39, "text": "ใช่ไหม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 41, "text": "ใช่แล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 43, "text": "รู้เรื่องนั่นได้ยังไง?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 44, "text": "ว่าแต่ ฉันจะถามคุณทำไมเนี่ย..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 45, "text": "ในเมื่อคุณมาที่นี่ได้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 46, "text": "คุณคงจะรู้อะไรเยอะแล้วล่ะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 48, "text": "แป๊บนะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 49, "text": "ฉันขอนั่งหน่อย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 51, "text": "แล้ว..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 53, "text": "ฉันไม่รู้จะพูดยังไงดี..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 54, "text": "แต่ฉันต้องไปต่อ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 55, "text": "และตามแหวนนี่ไป"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 57, "text": "คุณมีแหวนเธอด้วยเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 58, "text": "มิน่าล่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 59, "text": "คุณถึงเจอที่นี่"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 60, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 61, "text": "ใช่แล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 62, "text": "เพราะงั้น ช่วยฉันหน่อยได้ไหม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 63, "text": "เรื่องสวิตช์น่ะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 65, "text": "ได้สิ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 66, "text": "ฉันจะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 67, "text": "ไปช่วยดึงสวิตช์..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 70, "text": "มิตะ ไม่เอาน่า..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 71, "text": "ตื่นก่อนสิ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 72, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 73, "text": "อ้อ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 74, "text": "โอเค"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 75, "text": "ไปกันเถอะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 78, "text": "// MitaDreamer fall"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 79, "text": "ลุกขึ้นเร็ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 80, "text": "เธอง่วงขนาดนั้นเลยเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 81, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 82, "text": "// MitaDreamer again sleep"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 83, "text": "ตื่นก่อน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 84, "text": "เราถึงแล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 87, "text": "// Switches"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 88, "text": "เอาล่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 89, "text": "ฉันพร้อมแล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 90, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 91, "text": "ฉันก็พร้อมแล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 93, "text": "ถ้างั้น"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 94, "text": "ฉันจะเริ่ม"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 95, "text": "นับ 1 ถึง 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 96, "text": "นับเสร็จเราก็จะดึงสวิตช์ลงพร้อมกัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 97, "text": "โอเคไหม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 99, "text": "โอเค อย่าหลับก่อนละกัน!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 100, "text": "เอาเลย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 103, "text": "3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 104, "text": "2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 105, "text": "1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 106, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 107, "text": "// Player lose 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 108, "text": "นี่คุณตั้งใจไหมเนี่ย?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 109, "text": "เร็วเข้า"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 110, "text": "มาลองอีกที..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 112, "text": "// Player lose 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 113, "text": "อีกแล้วเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 114, "text": "ไม่เอาน่า"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 115, "text": "ฉัน..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 116, "text": "ฉันจะหลับอยู่แล้ว..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 118, "text": "// Player lose 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 119, "text": "ฉันจะไม่ไหวแล้วนะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 120, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 122, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 123, "text": "เยี่ยม"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 124, "text": "ขอบคุณนะ มิตะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 125, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 126, "text": "ไม่เป็นไร"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 129, "text": "ทำไมประตู..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 130, "text": "มันเปิด..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 131, "text": "ช้าจังเลย..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 134, "text": "ฉันไปนอนแล้วนะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 136, "text": "// Why kitchen?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 137, "text": "ทำไมถึงเข้ามาในครัวล่ะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 138, "text": "ถ้าฉันเผลอหลับไปบนพื้นเย็น ๆ นี่"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 139, "text": "มันคือความผิดของคุณนะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 141, "text": "// Why bathroom?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 142, "text": "ฉันไม่เข้าใจ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 143, "text": "คุณให้ฉันช่วยดึงสวิตช์อะไรในนี้งั้นเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 144, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 145, "text": "// Put button"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 146, "text": "ไม่เห็นมีอะไรเกิดขึ้นเลย?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 147, "text": "ปุ่มนี่มีไว้ใช้ทำอะไรกันแน่?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 149, "text": "// Cofee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 150, "text": "เอากาแฟเพิ่มหน่อยไหม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 151, "text": "เดี๋ยวเธอจะเผลอหลับเอาอีก"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 152, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 153, "text": "อะไรนะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 154, "text": "ม่ายย..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 155, "text": "กาแฟนั่นรสชาติแย่จะตาย..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 156, "text": "ฉันยังไหวอยู่น่า..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 157, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 158, "text": "// Button"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 159, "text": "มิตะ ปุ่มนั่นมันไม่ทำงาน!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 160, "text": "เธอได้ยินฉันไหม!?"}
